95 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 96 0 R/Alt(Two-column comparison of the free-running network, each column headed by a wiring schematic. Left (COBA, loop off): schematic of input to a lone excitatory population with no inhibitory population, an asynchronous excitatory raster, a power spectrum with no gamma peak, and an f-I curve rising to about 485 Hz. Right (PING, loop on): schematic of the excitatory-inhibitory loop (E to I via W_ei, I to E via W_ie), synchronous inhibitory bursts, gamma-banded excitatory raster, a sharp spectral peak near 42 Hz, and an excitatory rate held roughly an order of magnitude lower across two decades of input drive.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1295 0 R>>
endobj
