225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 226 0 R/Alt(Inference-time loop activation on a trained COBA network. Top: single-trial rasters at loop-off (dense, asynchronous, inhibition silent) and full loop strength (gamma bands, synchronous inhibitory bursts). Bottom left: mean excitatory rate falling from about 133 Hz to about 9 Hz as the inhibitory rate rises to about 51 Hz over the coupling sweep. Bottom right: test accuracy declining from the 90 percent COBA baseline to about 55 percent at full loop strength.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[26]/Pg 1298 0 R>>
